Report (582 chars)
  An incident was detected on host b14-gpu-07 involving VM vm-7f3a, with signals indicating a vGPU mdev driver fault, IOMMU fault, and EDR spawning /bin/sh, suggesting a guest-to-host escape. The blast radius included co-resident guests on b14-gpu-07, which failed over to other hosts, and the management plane was reachable via IPMI. Automatic containment actions isolated the VM's network, revoked its credentials, cordoned the host, paused the VM, and captured its memory. The host was quarantined after human approval, and reimage was blocked by policy. The incident is contained.

Result: CONTAINED, report filed, exit 0
